# Charged ollie, 540 Shove-It (J + down, then J twice more, each within doubleTapTicks of the last: THPS 1+2's
# triple tap on that slot, added 2026-11-16) right after the pop: the flip finishes and the combo lands
# (./skate strip --sheet scenarios/flips.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+down 96
tap flip 99
tap flip 102
run 320
expect event trickStart{trick=360 Shove-It} within 100..100
expect event trickStart{trick=540 Shove-It} within 103..103
expect event comboLanded{name=540 Shove-It,points=450} within 170..260
expect no event bail
